---------------------------------------------------------------------
B no init                    |   60 |      59 |     1449 |   1449
       RTL halted@12   GATE halted@never
       first divergence: cycle 2  element pc[1]  RTL=1 GATE=x  [X-ORIGIN]

C gate randomised (RTL X)    |   12 |      12 |      500 |      0
       RTL halted@12   GATE halted@5
       first divergence: cycle 1  element acc_w[0]  RTL=x GATE=0  [VALUE MISMATCH]

E co-init seed=1             |    5 |       0 |        0 |      0
